From 206e283bbc427435e907d86222bd4d79c43feca6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ValdikSS <iam@valdikss.org.ru>
Date: Wed, 8 Oct 2025 01:20:39 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add support for Samsung M2020 series, HP Laser 10x, Laser MFP
 13x (#9)

- Limit the bandwidth to make Samsung M2026 work
- Introduce PPD QPDL->SpecialBandWidth boolean for Samsung M2020 Series
- Add Samsung M2020 Series to samsung.drv and Makefile
- Add HP Laser 103/107/108, HP Laser MFP 135/137 support (Samsung M2020)
- Use HP Laser name attributes from the original (proprietary hp-uld driver) PPD file
---
